<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bell &amp; Howell initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bell &amp; Howell initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Mesirow Financial said on Friday it initiated coverage of Bell &amp; Howell Co with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>- Analyst Mark Johnson said he considers the recent pull back in the price of Bell &amp; Howell a buying opportunity.</p>
<p>- The Skokie, Ill.-based company has highly predictable revenues, with 50 percent derived from subscriptions and pre-paid services, which have a renewal rate of about 90 percent, Johnson said.</p>
<p>- Mesirow sees upper single-digit growth for the company, it said.</p>
<p>- Bell &amp; Howell shares were up 1/4 at 30-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
